1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,502
Altitude: twelve thousand meters.

2
00:00:03,502 --> 00:00:06,940
The Israeli pilot checked the coordinates.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,741
Then he checked again.

4
00:00:08,741 --> 00:00:11,116
The target was not a soldier.

5
00:00:11,116 --> 00:00:17,420
But in war, the line between civilians and the powerful exists only on paper.

6
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:24,297
He thought of his mother in Haifa — the woman who never wanted her son in this seat.

7
00:00:24,297 --> 00:00:29,571
The release button is pressed with two fingers. That's the rule.

8
00:00:29,571 --> 00:00:31,549
One finger is a mistake.

9
00:00:31,549 --> 00:00:34,103
Two fingers make it a decision.

10
00:00:34,103 --> 00:00:36,246
There were two explosions.

11
00:00:36,246 --> 00:00:38,553
The first took off the roof.

12
00:00:38,553 --> 00:00:40,861
No one remembers the second.

13
00:00:40,861 --> 00:00:44,816
Memory only reaches as far as the moment before.

